360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (Our database includes several views and a materialized view to improve reporting and provide helpful insights. The product_summary view gives a detailed overview of products and their inventory adjustments. It includes data like product ID, name, category, current stock quantity, and the total quantities added or removed from stock. This is especially helpful for tracking product trends and managing stock flow. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
361 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (The activity_log_summary view focuses on summarizing user activities, such as user ID, username, total actions performed, and the tables and columns that were modified. This view serves as a simple audit trail, making it easier for admins to monitor system activities. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (Lastly, the mview_stock_critical materialized view keeps track of products with low stock levels by displaying product ID, name, and current stock quantity for any item with less than 10 units. This view is super handy for identifying which products need restocking right away. Together, these views and the materialized view help keep the system organized and efficient.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
